{"id":51752,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/epic-azores\/"},"modified":"2026-09-02T18:54:32","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T17:54:32","slug":"epic-azores","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/epic-azores\/","title":{"rendered":"EPIC Azores 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">EPIC Azores 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>EPIC Azores 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se de <strong>3 a 5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> na deslumbrante <strong>Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel<\/strong>, nos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>, tendo como base e centro nevr\u00e1lgico o Pavilh\u00e3o A\u00e7or Arena em <strong>Vila Franca do Campo<\/strong>. Considerada uma das maiores aventuras atl\u00e2nticas do trail mundial, a prova cruza caldeiras vulc\u00e2nicas, florestas densas de laurissilva, lagoas ic\u00f3nicas e arribas costeiras dram\u00e1ticas por cinco concelhos micaelenses.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com coordena\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Ansibikers<\/strong> e certifica\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA, UTMB Index e ATRP, o evento arranca na quinta-feira, 3 de Dezembro, \u00e0s <strong>22:00<\/strong> com a m\u00edtica prova rainha <strong>EPIC 100M (167 km e 9252m D+)<\/strong> a partir das Portas da Cidade de Ponta Delgada. O programa integra tamb\u00e9m o <strong>EPIC 100K (108 km)<\/strong>, <strong>EPIC 60K (63 km)<\/strong>, <strong>EPIC 30K (34 km)<\/strong>, <strong>EPIC 15K (17 km)<\/strong>, caminhada DayWalk e escal\u00f5es Kids.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 22:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; wi