<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">EPIC DayWalk &#038; Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">8.00 \u20ac &#8211; 20.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es do EPIC Azores 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O EPIC Azores 2026 decorre entre 3 e 5 de Dezembro de 2026 na Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores), com secretariado, meta principal e cerim\u00f3nia de pr\u00e9mios no Pavilh\u00e3o A\u00e7or Arena, em Vila Franca do Campo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida das provas principais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O EPIC 100M parte a 3 de Dezembro \u00e0s 22:00 de Ponta Delgada; o EPIC 100K a 4 de Dezembro \u00e0s 21:00 do Nordeste; e no S\u00e1bado, 5 de Dezembro, partem o EPIC 60K (08:00 na Ribeira Grande), o EPIC 30K (09:30 em \u00c1gua de Pau) e o EPIC 15K (10:00).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza o EPIC 100M (167 km \/ 9252m D+), EPIC 100K (108 km \/ 6128m D+), EPIC 60K (63 km \/ 2918m D+), EPIC 30K (34 km \/ 1793m D+), EPIC 15K (17 km \/ 818m D+), a Caminhada DayWalk e o EPIC Kids.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As provas atribuem pontos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o internacionais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o evento \u00e9 pontu\u00e1vel para os circuitos internacionais ITRA e UTMB World Series, conferindo qualifica\u00e7\u00f5es e Running Stones conforme a dist\u00e2ncia conclu\u00edda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial e consultar os resultados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais efetuam-se atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Stop and Go (stopandgo.net). O acompanhamento live com geolocaliza\u00e7\u00e3o e as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais s\u00e3o disponibilizados no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"EPIC Azores 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o A\u00e7or Arena, Vila Franca do Campo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Franca do Campo\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Ansibikers \/ ATRP \/ ITRA \/ UTMB\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es do EPIC Azores 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O EPIC Azores 2026 decorre entre 3 e 5 de Dezembro de 2026 na Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores), com secretariado, meta principal e cerim\u00f3nia de pr\u00e9mios no Pavilh\u00e3o A\u00e7or Arena, em Vila Franca do Campo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida das provas principais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O EPIC 100M parte a 3 de Dezembro \u00e0s 22:00 de Ponta Delgada; o EPIC 100K a 4 de Dezembro \u00e0s 21:00 do Nordeste; e no S\u00e1bado, 5 de Dezembro, partem o EPIC 60K (08:00 na Ribeira Grande), o EPIC 30K (09:30 em \u00c1gua de Pau) e o EPIC 15K (10:00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza o EPIC 100M (167 km \/ 9252m D+), EPIC 100K (108 km \/ 6128m D+), EPIC 60K (63 km \/ 2918m D+), EPIC 30K (34 km \/ 1793m D+), EPIC 15K (17 km \/ 818m D+), a Caminhada DayWalk e o EPIC Kids.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"As provas atribuem pontos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o internacionais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o evento \u00e9 pontu\u00e1vel para os circuitos internacionais ITRA e UTMB World Series, conferindo qualifica\u00e7\u00f5es e Running Stones conforme a dist\u00e2ncia conclu\u00edda.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial e consultar os resultados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais efetuam-se atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Stop and Go (stopandgo.net). O acompanhamento live com geolocaliza\u00e7\u00e3o e as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais s\u00e3o disponibilizados no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51753,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,622,739,498,499],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5"